							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "I just got the "
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"marks": [
										{
											"type": "link",
											"attrs": {
												"href": "http://webjam.site",
												"target": "_blank",
												"rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
												"class": null
											}
										}
									],
									"text": "webjam.site"
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": " domain."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "Make it available to the community by crafting a Vercel based server that is able to receive a fully made website; zipped, source and built artifacts; and host it for X number of days at a randomly generated domain name."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "The server gives back a deployment key that allows the user to erase the deployment, and to re-deploy the site on the same location."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "It can also take a website with a CNAME "
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"marks": [
										{
											"type": "link",
											"attrs": {
												"href": "http://something.webjam.site",
												"target": "_blank",
												"rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
												"class": null
											}
										}
									],
									"text": "something.webjam.site"
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": " and it should attempt to use the subdomain if available."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "Simple. Practical."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "Turn it into a protocol so that anyone can host a "
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"marks": [
										{
											"type": "link",
											"attrs": {
												"href": "http://webjam.site",
												"target": "_blank",
												"rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
												"class": null
											}
										}
									],
									"text": "webjam.site"
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": " hosting; and leave the inners an implementation detail. I know I can craft one on Vercel with wildcard domains for free because I’ve done it before for "
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"marks": [
										{
											"type": "link",
